#[doc = r"Return six median FXW hydraulic parameters for a soil textural class.

# Arguments

  * soil_texture: Soil textural class used to select the Table 1 median FXW parameters.

# Returns

A [`Rudiyanto2021Parameters`].

# Models

  * h(theta): Modified Fredlund-Xing model of Wang et al. (2018), equations (1)-(4).
  * k(h): FXW hydraulic conductivity, equations (5)-(7).

# Notes

Prediction target: Six representative FXW retention and conductivity parameters.
Table 1 medians, rather than means, define the class PTF in sections 2.3.1 and 3.3.3. Bulk
density is not returned as a hydraulic parameter.
Parameters n and m are independent FXW parameters; do not impose the van Genuchten restriction m
= 1 - 1/n.

# Warnings

Some classes have few observations; sandy clay is not represented.
Independent-soil validation of the class PTF is identified as future work in section 3.3.3."]
#[cfg_attr(feature = "inline", inline)]
#[must_use]
pub fn calc_ptf_rudiyanto2021_texture(
    soil_texture: NeuroFXTextureClass,
) -> Rudiyanto2021Parameters {
    soil_texture.into()
}
